# Known upstream as dragonflydb/dragonfly issue 8646 (RESULTS.md, finding 2): SAVE renames its
# files into place and answers OK without an fsync, so the power cut at the end takes the
# newest snapshots away, and the recovery boot loads an older one. From seed 99 of exploration
# ex2 with only the cut kept.
# commands: anytime_read eventually_settle first_settle parallel_driver_px parallel_driver_set parallel_driver_tx serial_driver_save serial_driver_takeover
# expect: violation      (change to ok when the bug is fixed)
disk=cut dseed=7d395f3a77b937a8 | run C=30 W=b63a6982,p1,q3,r150
